Run shell commands in admin mode.

```json
{
  "run": [{
    "method": "shell.run",
    "params": {
      "sudo": true,
      "message": "reg add HKLM\\SYSTEM\\CurrentControlSet\\Control\\FileSystem /v LongPathsEnabled /t REG_DWORD /d 1 /f",
